     "noteHtml": "The integrating-factor step behind <a class=\"ref ref-eq\" href=\"#eq/eq:energy_bounds\" data-label=\"eq:energy_bounds\">(4.14)</a>, for an integrable time coefficient and an absolutely continuous energy.",
