     "noteHtml": "The budget bound <a class=\"ref ref-eq\" href=\"#eq/eq:alpha_squared\" data-label=\"eq:alpha_squared\">(4.18)</a>–<a class=\"ref ref-eq\" href=\"#eq/eq:adaptive-alpha-budget\" data-label=\"eq:adaptive-alpha-budget\">(4.5)</a> from the dissipation bound, and the centroid estimate <a class=\"ref ref-eq\" href=\"#eq/eq:adaptive-centroid-error\" data-label=\"eq:adaptive-centroid-error\">(4.6)</a> under the equality feedback.",
