   "title": "Shock computations with and without Lloyd",
   "number": "Figures 6.1–6.3",
   "extract": {
    "from": "Figure~\\ref{fig:1} shows the Vorono\\\"i tessellation at the first recorded time",
    "to": "This confirms that the Lloyd correction does not affect the consistency of the method."
   },
